}}}

So I tried adding `mark` to the [https://github.com/WordPress/WordPress/blob/822782a917bf08d2ce89901aba5942de0137127d/wp-includes/formatting.php#L106 $default_no_texturize_tags] variable array and found that this solved the problem.

My guess is that we might need to update this variable so that all elements used in inline formatting are allowed in it.

